  "title": "CAD-to-CAD Helps Solve Titusville Burglaries",
  "summary": "In modern public safety operations, outcomes often depend less on a single agency’s capabilities and more on how effectively agencies share information in real time. A case in Titusville, Florida, demonstrates how CAD-to-CAD interoperability between the Titusville Police Department (TPD) and the Brevard County Sheriff’s Office (BCSO) played a critical role in identifying, tracking, and arresting a repeat offender. Early Encounters Build a Pattern The case began in June, when...",
